# Handling connections between multiple peers

* Each peer-to-peer connection must be established independently
  - Thus, for 3 peers, there will be 2 connections on each peer to the other 2.
  
## Serverless Signaling Channel

Each 'file' is json object of the following form:
{
    "start_time": "",    // This field is used for determing who initiates a connection.  Older peers always initiate.
    "peer1_id": [ ... ], // The signaling messages to peer1
    "peer2_id": [ ... ], // The signaling messages to peer2
    ...                  // For all peers
}


